title: Sophos Firewall: Memory
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 RAM and swap usage in percent as reported by SFOS (sfosMemoryPercentUsage,
 sfosSwapPercentUsage). Unlike HOST-RESOURCES-MIB these values do not include
 cache and buffers.

 Default levels: RAM {WARN} at 80%, {CRIT} at 90%; swap {WARN} at 50%,
 {CRIT} at 75%. Configurable via the rule "Sophos Firewall memory".

discovery:
 One service is created if the device reports its memory usage.
